### 1. Login as an ADMIN account (200 OK, returns admin info + tokens)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "admin"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.data.token.accessToken);
  client.global.set("adminRefreshToken", response.body.data.token.refreshToken);
%}

### Get ADMIN account information (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}


